SUMMARY:Letterpress Fundamentals
DTSTAMP:20260805T111657Z
DTSTART:20260808T133000Z
DESCRIPTION:*This course meets 4 times*\nInterested in working with histori
	c wood-type and antique printing equipment? Learn the fundamentals of Lett
	erpress in this in-depth\, 4-week course taught by Rekha Basra! Students w
	ill be introduced to typesetting\, measuring\, and printing their own lett
	erpress poster using our Line-O-Scribes and Vandercook cylinder presses. S
	tudents will leave with their own posters and the skills to print with let
	terpress on their own. Additionally\, students will receive one free pass 
	for an Open Studio reservation to continue printing at Red Bird.\nNo exper
	ience required\; All levels are welcome\nMeets Saturdays from 1:30 – 5:30p
	m\nJuly 18 – August 8 (4 weeks)\n\nhttps://eastendhouston.com/event/letter
	press-fundamentals-4/\n\nFrom East End Farmers Market
URL:https://eastendhouston.com/event/letterpress-fundamentals-4/
LOCATION:Red Bird Press\, 708 Telephone\, Houston\, TX\, 77023\, United Sta
	tes
