SUMMARY:The Murder Mystery Co's Dinner Theater Show at Saltgrass Steak Hous
	e
DTSTAMP:20260805T111657Z
DTSTART:20260808T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Murder Mystery Co. presents a hilarious\, interactive murde
	r mystery dinner event\, where you just might be the killer\, at Saltgrass
	 Steak House in the Washington Corridor\, just south of the Heights. \nMin
	gle with intriguing suspects\, uncover shocking secrets\, and savor a tast
	y 3-course meal. But anyone\, including you\, may end up as the cold-blood
	ed killer. \nThere’s a new mystery with a new theme every month. \nFor Aug
	ust\, the whodunit is set at an 1950s sock hop. \nAdmission\nTickets start
	 at $69.45. Order tickets or learn more. \nCall the box office at 888-659-
	2952 to avoid fees and save $9. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sp
	onsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and
	 more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, bu
	siness\, or offer across all of our channels.\n\nhttps://365thingsinhousto
	n.com/calendar/the-murder-mystery-cos-dinner-theater-show-at-saltgrass-ste
	ak-house-august-2026/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/the-murder-mystery-cos-dinner-t
	heater-show-at-saltgrass-steak-house-august-2026/
LOCATION:Saltgrass Steak House\, 1803 Shepherd Dr\, Houston\, TX\, 77007\, 
	United States
