SUMMARY:FirstCheck 201: Smart Angels Do Smart Deals (Online)
DTSTAMP:20260805T111658Z
DTSTART:20260813T173000Z
DESCRIPTION:Register here: https://luma.com/gn2md6vu​ \nThis is where you s
	top learning about investing and start operating like a Smart Angel Invest
	or. You’ll learn how disciplined investors evaluate opportunities and begi
	n making your own invest-or-pass decisions. After this course\, you’ll hav
	e structured evaluation criteria\, the ability to justify a decision\, and
	 the beginning of an investor’s discipline. \nThis session is ideal for th
	e following investment related stakeholders: \n-Prospective Angel Investor
	s who want to learn more about the world of Angel Investing\n-Investment A
	dvisors (RIA/FA) who are looking for alternative investments for their cli
	ents\n-Entrepreneurs who want to learn more about what Angels are looking 
	for in their deals\n-Entrepreneurs who want to meet/network with Angel Inv
	estors\n\nhttps://iondistrict.com/event/firstcheck-201-smart-angels-do-sma
	rt-deals-online/\n\nFrom Ion District
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/firstcheck-201-smart-angels-do-smart-deal
	s-online/
LOCATION:Ion\, 4201 Main Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ion-district
CATEGORIES:Ion District
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://iondistrict.com/wp
 -content/uploads/2026/02/Upstream-FB-Event-v002-1.jpg?ver=1771824296
