SUMMARY:Community Shredding Day
DTSTAMP:20260805T111658Z
DTSTART:20260815T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Community Shredding Day! At 2501 Central Parkway\, 
	Suite A4. \nGet your items safely and professionally destroyed by our team
