 content/uploads/2026/07/Launch-Kit-Pokemon-Mini-Con.png
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07
 /Launch-Kit-Pokemon-Mini-Con.png
UID:zWqjoWcbKxUbhBNqvwweR
SUMMARY:Pokemon Mini Con
DTSTAMP:20260805T111658Z
DTSTART:20260822T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:Pokémon Mini Con – Pick Your Starter\, Start Your Adventure\nAs
	k ten Pokémon fans how they got started and you’ll hear ten different answ
	ers. It might have been opening a Game Boy for the first time. Or racing h
	ome to watch the anime after school. Maybe it was pulling a favorite card 
	from a pack and carrying it everywhere for months. Pokémon Mini Con is all
	 about those moments! \n  \n📅 August 22\, 2026 | 10AM – 5PM\n📍 9700 Bisson
	net St\, #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036\n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n🔥 E
	vent Highlights 🔥\n  \n🛍️ Pokémon Marketplace\nThe marketplace floor at Pok
	émon Mini Con feels a lot like stepping into the tall grass on Route 1. Ev
	ery booth brings a new encounter\, with cards to chase\, collectibles to d
	iscover\, and hidden gems waiting to be found. You never know when you’ll 
	run into the piece that completes your collection or the find you didn’t k
	now you needed. \n  \n🦹‍♂️ Pokémon Cosplay Showcase\nSuit up\, Trainers! Tran
	sform into your favorite Pokémon characters or Gym Leaders and show off yo
	ur moves in our cosplay showcase. \n  \n🎨 Pokémon Face Painting and Hair B
	raids – Both Days\nChoose your favorite Pokémon\, show off your team spiri
	t\, and add a little extra magic to your day with face painting starting a
	t $6 and braids ranging from $3-20 (based on complexity) ✨ Hosted by @voil
	slinda and @will.and.whimsy \n  \n⚡ Be a Vendor\nNew encounter unlocked: P
	okémon Mini Con vendor applications are open! If you specialize in cards\,
	 collectibles\, artwork\, or all things Pokémon\, we want you to be part o
	f the adventure. → https://tinyurl.com/CCSGuestVendorFromHouston \n  \n🌊 C
	alling all Pokémon Fans\nEvery great Trainer needs the right team. We’re l
	ooking for collaborators ready to join the journey to the Elite Four. \n🕹️ 
	Activity Hosts → https://forms.gle/74Qvuv9PFzeDVF1V8 \n🎤 Workshops & Panel
	s → https://forms.gle/cdpspG6VpUtpaNZ7A \n🙌 Volunteer Sign-Up → https://fo
	rms.gle/15zMGTqZPSGKjGdy6 \nHave a love for Pokémon and want to be part of
	 the adventure? Bring your passion\, join the journey\, and let’s chat! 📩 
	\n  \nFrom your first starter Pokémon to your latest collection addition\,
	 Pokémon Mini Con celebrates every step of the Trainer journey. 🧢\n\nhttps
	://ccs-houston.com/events/pokemon-mini-con/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/pokemon-mini-con/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT7H
END:VEVENT
