SUMMARY:Braille Club
DTSTAMP:20260805T111658Z
DTSTART:20260909T120000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Lighthouse will be hosting a weekly Braille Club to help pe
	ople learn functional Braille skills in a friendly group setting. The club
	 meets every Wednesday from 12:00 PM to 2:00 PM. \nWe will use fun games a
	nd activities to help everyone gain useful skills for daily life. Members 
	will learn how to read playing cards for games\, label items around their 
	homes\, and read signs and elevator buttons in public places. \nTo join th
	e club\, participants need access to email and a notebook to keep their ha
	ndout papers organized. \nBecause the group learns new things every week\,
	 it is highly recommended to attend each session so you do not miss out on
	 any important tips. \nREGISTER HERE.\n\nhttps://houstonlighthouse.org/eve
	nt/braille-club/2026-09-09/\n\nFrom Houston Lighthouse
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/braille-club/2026-09-09/
LOCATION:The Lighthouse of Houston\, 3602 West Dallas\, Houston\, TX\, 7701
	9\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-lighthouse
CATEGORIES:Houston Lighthouse
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
